# Design docs are part of this repo. A developer's global excludes may hide docs/superpowers/**
# (the superpowers plugin's default output path); this negation wins over core.excludesFile so
# new specs/plans are not silently left out of commits. AGENTS.md links to the spec.
!docs/superpowers/**
